OL,3,GNEWSAFootage of explosion shown to
OL,4,AOmagh bomb inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Omagh bomb inquiry has seen video
OL,7,Ffootage of the moment the device
OL,8,Fexploded and the immediate aftermath.
OL,10,FIt was filmed in McIlroy's shoe shop in
OL,11,Fthe town. Photographs taken of the
OL,12,Fdamage were also shown.
OL,14,FThe video footage was shown as part of
OL,15,Fa presentation and also had audio of
OL,16,Fthe Royal Ulster Constabulary (RUC)
OL,17,Fradio transmissions added.
OL,19,FThe inquiry heard the original audio
OL,20,Fwas "distressing".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
